storage module immutable oneI64 CSignedInt64 1
storage module immutable twoI64 CSignedInt64 2
storage module immutable byteBaseI64 CSignedInt64 256
storage module immutable notFound CSignedInt64 -1
storage module immutable zeroI32 CSignedInt32 0
storage module immutable oneI32 CSignedInt32 1
storage module immutable successExitCode ExitCode 0
storage module immutable failureExitCode ExitCode 1

