storage module immutable ctrlL KiloKeyCode 12
storage module immutable enterKey KiloKeyCode 13
storage module immutable ctrlQ KiloKeyCode 17
storage module immutable ctrlS KiloKeyCode 19
storage module immutable escKey KiloKeyCode 27
storage module immutable arrowLeft KiloKeyCode 1000
storage module immutable arrowRight KiloKeyCode 1001
storage module immutable arrowUp KiloKeyCode 1002
storage module immutable arrowDown KiloKeyCode 1003
storage module immutable delKey KiloKeyCode 1004
storage module immutable homeKey KiloKeyCode 1005
storage module immutable endKey KiloKeyCode 1006
